cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Agentic RAG for Legal Question Answering in Civil Law — research prototype
  and benchmark
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility archive for the IEEE Access paper: the agentic RAG prototype,
  the 300-question Korean Bar Examination benchmark, the baseline and ablation
  scripts, and the per-model results. Frozen as it stood for the paper; the
  maintained system is legal-search-mcp.
message: >-
  If you use this material in research, please cite the paper under
  preferred-citation.
